<Base title="How we make money" description="How Honest Penny is paid for today, and the rules we'll follow if that changes. Right now we earn nothing from any company we mention.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>How we make money</h1>
    <p><strong>Right now, we don't.</strong> As of November 24, 2026, Honest Penny earns nothing from any company, product or link on this site. It's paid for by the people who run it.</p>
    <h2>If that changes</h2>
    <p>To keep the site free, we may later earn money in these ways. We'll update this page first.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Marked links.</strong> Some companies pay a fee when someone signs up through a link. Any link like that will carry an asterisk (*). It will never change what we recommend or the order we list things in.</li>
      <li><strong>One clearly labelled sponsor in the weekly email.</strong> Kept apart from our own recommendations.</li>
      <li><strong>A paid budgeting app, later.</strong> The guides will stay free.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We won't take money for placement, rankings or reviews, and we won't sell your data. See our <a href="/editorial-code/">editorial code</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
